"answer": "Project Zenith is a high-priority initiative aimed at driving innovation, optimizing cloud storage, and enhancing data analytics and visualization. Key milestones include a kickoff in Q3 2023 (July 15th) with Marcus Cole as leader, followed by a phase one budget of $500,000 (later increased to a total approved budget of $2M). Sarah Tan leads the analytics aspect. Recent progress includes a breakthrough in predictive analytics, successful completion of the testing phase, and updated security protocols. The project involves gathering R&D ideas by July 20th, seeking stakeholder feedback by the end of November, and celebrating milestones on October 10th. A detailed report will be shared on November 20th."
